land-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle got 40% of normal in September to October and 48% in August to September. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 28% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
